$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=logsqlerpow  LOC_AFTER=?

* The square of the logarithm is eventually dominated by any positive power (Lean: eventually_log_sq_le_rpow in LogPow.lean): for every E e. RR+ there is a threshold beyond which ( log u ) ^ 2 <_ ( u ^c E ).

